      "text": "ESO supplies the Cloudflare token from Vault.\ncert-manager uses DNS-01 + public DoH self-checks.\nTLS Secrets → Cilium → edge Envoy.\nCertificates cover Argo CD and Hubble UI.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ESO supplies the Cloudflare token from Vault.\ncert-manager uses DNS-01 + public DoH self-checks.\nTLS Secrets → Cilium → edge Envoy.\nCertificates cover Argo CD and Hubble UI.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
